A||||15||BAM-BAM||Who has the best carpet kit?||||5||
Z||000000||BAM-BAM||09-17-2000||04:58 PM||||   I have just repaired my 85GT. It took all of 45 minutes. Not too bad considering that they paid me $2700.00 and I got to keep the car. Anyway I am going to go ahead and do the interior and I want to know who has the best carpet kit. I am definitely going with Mr. Mikes seats but have heard mixed reviews on his carpet kits. TIA for the help.<P> Later, BAM OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Don B. <BR>85GT||||reg||5
Z||000001||BAM-BAM||09-17-2000||10:48 PM||||  C'mon now, hook as brotha up. Lately it seems that therte are so many people here that it's difficult to get a question answered. Anyone out there that solve this mystery?<P> Late, BAM OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Don B. <BR>85GT||||reg||9
Z||000002||80's BOY||09-19-2000||10:18 AM||||i just bought a carpet kit for my 85 gt from ACC in Alabama. it fit perfect, and they sent me samples of colors and styles free even before i ordered. it was about $150 for the kit, but it is an exact fit with minimal trimming. they were highly recommended to me by some hot rodders in the area.||||reg||1
Z||000003||286SE'S||09-19-2000||11:18 AM||||80'S BOY,<BR>Was the carpet you bought a replacement or an overlay like Mr. Mikes sells? If it was a full replacement, how was the noise level after installation. The reason I ask is that the original carpet is THICK and HEAVY and also a thick pad glued to it. The only reason for this I believe is to cancel out the road noise not for a cushy feel. (Its actually very stiff) Thanks for the information.<BR>Terry<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000004||JAMIE||09-19-2000||11:44 AM||||I too just bought the carpet kit ACC sells.<BR>It is original GM carpet material and made to factory specs.I think the gray is appropriate for all years, but the tan changed somewhere along the way,don't know which year. <P>The stuff ACC sells has a jute backing, which is correct up to 1987. In 1988, a foam backing was used, but the carpet material is the same.<P>Jamie ||||reg||1
Z||000005||2xsess||09-19-2000||11:11 PM||||So the MrMikes kit doesn't have any backing? I was interested in his kit because you can get the door carpet and the back wall too. Plus it comes with the floor mats. <P><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>85GT||||reg||1
Z||000006||Oreif||09-20-2000||10:39 AM||||Mr. Mikes carpet is suppose to go on top of the stock carpet. Coyote has it in his GT and it looks great. He did the floor and the bottom of the doors.||||reg||1
Z||000007||80's BOY||09-20-2000||10:49 AM||||the ACC carpet is very stiff and has the padding under the center of each piece where your feet are. it covers the rear area behind the seat and also up to the sides of the center console. ||||reg||1
Z||000008||JAMIE||09-20-2000||11:49 AM||||You have to buy an extra 2 yards of carpet to do the lower door sections.||||reg||1
Z||000009||80's BOY||09-20-2000||12:43 PM||||hmmm....very true. i have custom panels so i didn't consider that for all other fieros. if mr. mike's has the door panels too, that obviously is the better deal since the price is about the same.||||reg||1
Z||000010||MikeSchaefer||09-20-2000||04:16 PM||||Hey Bam,<BR>Mr.Mike's is really nice.  It's easy to install too.  It does go on top of your existing carpet, so if that bothers you, you might look elsewhere.  But I don't see the need to, the fit and look is really nice.  It comes with a video, and you can order all of the parts needed for the entire interior carpeting job from Mike.<BR>Michael Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> <p>[This message has been edited by MikeSchaefer (edited 09-20-2000).]||||reg||6
Z||000011||2xsess||09-20-2000||07:03 PM||||I think MrMikes is the way to go, for about $170 + shipping you can do the whole interior.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>85GT||||reg||14
Z||000012||BAM-BAM||09-20-2000||11:58 PM||||  Thanks y'all, Mr. Mikes is the way I'll go. $170.00 is a good deal for the entire interior. Thanks again.<P>  BAM OUT!<P>------------------<BR>Don B. <BR>85GT||||reg||12
